+ *   then the aggregates: char +0x954 = max ShieldPercent +0xf4 (the damage root 0xb422d0 reads it at 0xb428fc:
+ *   pct = max(skill shield, +0x954), damage * (100 - pct) / 100), char +0x97c = max Invisibility +0x12c (0 none ..
